  "title": "TRIDENT: Efficient Triple-Task Learning of Dehazing, Depth, and Uncertainty Estimation for Underwater 3-D Robot Visual Perception",
  "summary": "TRIDENT proposes a novel learning-based sensing system for underwater 3D visual perception that addresses image enhancement, depth estimation, and uncertainty. It uses three parallelized decoders and a lightweight backbone for efficient feature sharing and demonstrates superior performance in standard datasets. Additionally, the model shows improved efficiency in both memory size and inference time, and its approach enables seamless extension from 2D to 3D tasks.",
